// Page Intro Text :
"P3535147405" "Hey {Hero}, guess what? It's that time of the year again! I've seen it  a million times in trillion places, but it's always a rush. Flowers blooming, glances across the dance floor - feelings of renewal, friendship, love...<br><br><color orange>DJ Zero busts out into a dance move or two, then abruptly stops.</color><br><br>Whoa, getting carried away again! So tell me, want to help make the season a success?"
// Answer Text :
"P1414048075" "Yes"
// Answer Text :
"P1719545583" "No"
// Answer Text :
"P744547406" "How?"
// Answer Text :
"P4060782435" "Leave"
// Page Yes Text :
"P3147126626" "Perfect! Let me attune you to the transdimensional Valentines, and pretty soon they'll all be taken care of. Voila!"
// Answer Text :
"P1884282623" "Wait, what? Valentines?"
// Answer Text :
"P2830358518" "Sure!"
// Answer Text :
"P3513136317" "Not interested"
// Page No Text :
"P3827959202" "Are you suuuure? You'll miss out on the fun! Plus, I haven't even told you what's up!"
// Answer Text :
"P1555047884" "What is this about?"
// Page Attune Text :
"P3283738872" "I knew it! You'll be perfect for it. Alright, here we go!<br><br><color orange>DJ Zero looks at you intently, cracks his knuckles and snaps both his fingers simultaneously.</color><br><br>Voila! I, DJ Zero, deputize you, {Hero}, as a transdimensional Valentine agent! Go forth and shake it up!"
// Page Exit Text :
"P1646993729" "Alright, well, let me know if you change your mind. You'll miss out on all the fun otherwise!"
// Page How Text :
"P1379976753" "Every year around this time, people send each other Valentines. Some are physical, some metaphorical, some are just wishes in the air. Most of them never get where they're supposed to go, sad face. So I thought to myself, 'Zero, old chum, wouldn't it be great if all those missed connections actually hit their target?' And before I knew it... Voila! Rules rewritten. Metaverse altered. To be honest, I didn't expect it to work. And actually, it didn't <i>quite</i> work..."
// Answer Text :
"P30804333" "Go on"
// Page How2 Text :
"P3050612981" "The only teensy snag is, I sort of jumbled it and left a lot of bits and pieces floating around in the ethereal planes. Long story short, there are a lot of Valentines which still need delivering, and now I've got no time to do it!<br><br>Look, it's real simple. All I have to do is attune you to the vibe of the Valentines. <color deepskyblue>You'll start running across them out in the world or when you do something Spring-related. Then all you gotta do is deliver them!</color><br><br>So how about it?"
// Answer Text :
"P1340165035" "Alright"

